    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕdĭcīnālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		medicina, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to medicine,
				medical, medicinal</i> (not ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ars, Cels. praef.: cucurbitulae,</span>”
				<i>cupping-glasses</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 10, 42, § 123</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mortarium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 22, 43, § 157</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scalprum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Compos. 53</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">digitus,</span>”
				<i>the next to the little finger</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 13</span></i>
			.</div>
